[h2]Build 0.9.17[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Return leftovers[/b] (Loader toggle, on by default): a Loader watches the belt behind it, and any item no machine on the network still needs - counting everything already on its way - is lifted off and put back into its storage, if the storage accepts it and has room. On a looping belt, leftovers go home at the first Loader whose storage takes them.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Conveyor arms now have [b]Rotate clockwise[/b] and [b]Rotate counter-clockwise[/b] buttons, so they can face any of the four directions in place (replacing Reverse and Rotate).
[/list]
